## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant isolation with Kinesis Streams and DynamoDB catalog
- Glue Schema Registry for backward/forward compatibility
- Runtime data quality checks and DLQ handling
- Idempotent writes and cross-region S3 replication
- OpenTelemetry tracing across services

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-idempotent write to DynamoDB
async function idempotentWrite(event, db) {
  const key = event.deviceId + '|' + event.ts;
  await db.put({
    TableName: 'idempotency',
    Item: { key, ts: event.ts },
    ConditionExpression: 'attribute_not_exists(key)'
  }).promise();
  return true;
}
```

